<article class="lk-article">
<h1 id="install">Install<a href="#install" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a>
</h1>
<p>Install the tool, then <a href="macos.html#homebrew">read about macOS</a>.</p>
<h2 id="requirements">Requirements<a href="#requirements" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a>
</h2>
<p>You need Rust.</p>
<h2 id="steps">Steps<a href="#steps" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a>
</h2>
<div class="lk-steps">
<h3 id="download">Download<a href="#download" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a>
</h3>
<p>Fetch it.</p>
<h3 id="run">Run<a href="#run" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a>
</h3>
<p>Run it, then go <a href="../index.html">back home</a>.</p>
</div>
